---
/**
 * Directions.astro — the single, responsive library gateway for /.
 *
 * The marks deliberately remain free-standing: the SVG itself carries the
 * interaction instead of being placed inside another dashboard/card system.
 */
---
<section class="h-home-gateway h-reveal h-scroll-target" id="issledovat" aria-labelledby="hDirectionsLabel">
  <header class="h-home-section-head">
    <div>
      <p class="h-section-label">Исследовать библиотеку</p>
      <h2 id="hDirectionsLabel">Выберите не раздел, а способ исследования</h2>
    </div>
    <p>Четыре входа ведут к тем же материалам, но помогают начать с нужного масштаба: точного ответа, цельной серии, исторического контекста или визуальной карты.</p>
  </header>

  <nav class="h-home-routes" aria-label="Основные направления библиотеки">
    <a class="h-home-route h-reveal h-reveal-d1" href="/articles/" data-home-route="reading">
      <span class="h-home-route__index" aria-hidden="true">01</span>
      <svg class="h-home-route__mark" viewBox="0 0 96 96" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
        <path class="h-route-line h-route-line--quiet" d="M18 22.5h23c4.7 0 7 2.3 7 7V76c0-5.2-3.8-8-9.2-8H18V22.5Z"/>
        <path class="h-route-line" d="M78 22.5H55c-4.7 0-7 2.3-7 7V76c0-5.2 3.8-8 9.2-8H78V22.5Z"/>
        <path class="h-route-spark" d="M48 22V12m-8.5 3.5-4-7M56.5 15.5l4-7"/>
      </svg>
      <span class="h-home-route__copy">
        <strong>Статьи и ответы</strong>
        <span>Экзегеза, богословие, переводы и непростые вопросы</span>
      </span>
      <span class="h-home-route__arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
    </a>

    <a class="h-home-route h-reveal h-reveal-d2" href="/nagornaya/" data-home-route="series">
      <span class="h-home-route__index" aria-hidden="true">02</span>
      <svg class="h-home-route__mark" viewBox="0 0 96 96" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
        <path class="h-route-line h-route-line--quiet" d="M19 72c8-11.7 16.2-17.5 24.5-17.5S60 60.3 77 72"/>
        <path class="h-route-line" d="M25 58c7.1-14 14.8-21 23-21s15.9 7 23 21"/>
        <path class="h-route-line" d="M34 41c4.2-10 8.8-15 14-15s9.8 5 14 15"/>
        <circle class="h-route-spark" cx="48" cy="18" r="3"/>
      </svg>
      <span class="h-home-route__copy">
        <strong>Последовательные серии</strong>
        <span>Цельные исследования, в которых лучше идти от части к части</span>
      </span>
      <span class="h-home-route__arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
    </a>

    <a class="h-home-route h-reveal h-reveal-d3" href="/biografii/" data-home-route="history">
      <span class="h-home-route__index" aria-hidden="true">03</span>
      <svg class="h-home-route__mark" viewBox="0 0 96 96" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
        <circle class="h-route-line" cx="48" cy="30" r="12"/>
        <path class="h-route-line h-route-line--quiet" d="M24 74c2.5-17 10.5-25.5 24-25.5S69.5 57 72 74"/>
        <path class="h-route-spark" d="M18 63h10M68 63h10M22 52l8 4M66 56l8-4"/>
      </svg>
      <span class="h-home-route__copy">
        <strong>Люди и история</strong>
        <span>Биографии служителей, движения, эпохи и живой контекст</span>
      </span>
      <span class="h-home-route__arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
    </a>

    <a class="h-home-route h-reveal h-reveal-d4" href="/karty/" data-home-route="maps">
      <span class="h-home-route__index" aria-hidden="true">04</span>
      <svg class="h-home-route__mark" viewBox="0 0 96 96" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
        <circle class="h-route-line h-route-line--quiet" cx="48" cy="48" r="27"/>
        <path class="h-route-line" d="M48 17c10 10.4 15 20.7 15 31S58 68.6 48 79c-10-10.4-15-20.7-15-31s5-20.6 15-31Z"/>
        <path class="h-route-line" d="M22 39h52M22 57h52"/>
        <circle class="h-route-spark" cx="66" cy="31" r="4"/>
      </svg>
      <span class="h-home-route__copy">
        <strong>Карты и связи</strong>
        <span>Визуальные исследования, маршруты, события и временные линии</span>
      </span>
      <span class="h-home-route__arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
    </a>
  </nav>

  <p class="h-home-gateway__hint">Наведите или нажмите на знак — он мягко меняет состояние, не превращаясь в отдельную плитку.</p>
</section>
